{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:46 2026-05-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:46 2026-05-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:46 2026-05-14 HKT</p><p>大埔發生火警。今日（14日）早上7時23分，汀角路83號過渡性房屋「樂善村」有單位起火。救援人員到場，消防員開喉灌救，約10分鐘將火救熄。一名男子頭髮燒焦受輕傷，清醒由救護車送往大埔那打素醫院治理。</p><p>火警中約20名居民自行疏散，初步懷疑涉及一輛電動單車充電時起火，消防正調查原因。</p><img alt=\"現場是大埔「樂善村」。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/333b86d94150f253a9a1e67e1cfad57b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_091336247_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/447ef8c12c1e7e35d1a4b577f63061c2/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_091336247.jpg\"/><img alt=\"大埔「樂善村」發生火警。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3f05e0d3cc722bf4ba9e43bc2d1aed57/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_092213018.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4e024a729db91e9ded86f3549a4fc47d/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_092213018_02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/162292691712f6a9368d31f35f8053c9/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_092213018_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d5e2724d32e56c72e56bc06a9d0bbfa0/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_091336247_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"火警中一名男住戶燒傷送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5a6cb013f9e2f6ccfceb49f39ba93740/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_091336247_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dd6b86993d3e095d6038a7fb9644387a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_091336247_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3f3d8225af0335033e754ebb6784f37d/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_091336247_07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a40589e7fb06d699da48f7d142759078/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_091336247_08.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T01:32:47.209402+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}